        <content verticalAlign="top" paddingTop="3.6" paddingBottom="3.6" paddingLeft="7.2" paddingRight="7.2" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" />
      </shape>
      <shape width="316.8" height="21.6" topLeftX="70.56" topLeftY="331.2" type="text" id="bMe">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(23, 82, 122, 1)" fontSize="14.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">关键判断</span></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="315.36" height="108" topLeftX="70.56" topLeftY="355.68" type="text" id="bMV">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ul listStyle="pptx-bullet">
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:17.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">重建结果不逐字正确，但在语义层面保持了较强一致性——学的不是声音，是意义。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:17.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">意义的重建可以跨模态：听到的语言、想象说的语言、无声视频，共用同一个解码器。</span></p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="481.8959842519685" height="158.4" topLeftX="433.44000000000005" topLeftY="142.56" presetHandlers="9.359856" type="round-rect" id="bRS">
