        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(27, 140, 153, 1)" fontSize="16.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">测到了什么</span></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430.0559842519685" height="113.76" topLeftX="459.36" topLeftY="181.44" type="text" id="bMw">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ul listStyle="pptx-bullet">
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:17.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">72–82% 的时间点，解码结果与原始故事的 BERTScore 显著高于随机水平。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:17.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">只让被试阅读解码出来的文字，16 道阅读理解题中答对 9 道——解码文本在行为上真的可用。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:17.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">在多个皮层区域都能分别解出连续语言，不是单一区域的产物。</span></p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </content>
      </shape>
