        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><strong><span color="rgba(217, 138, 33, 1)" fontSize="16.0" fontFamily="Heiti SC" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">但不能就此说「读心」</span></strong></p>
        </content>
      </shape>
      <shape width="430.0559842519685" height="112.32" topLeftX="459.36" topLeftY="349.9200000000001" type="text" id="bRO">
        <content verticalAlign="top" fontSize="16" fontFamily="思源黑体" color="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)" textAlign="left">
          <ul listStyle="pptx-bullet">
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">跨被试训练的 decoder 只略高于随机——训练必须个体化，且需要被试配合。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">默算、默想动物、讲另一个故事，都能显著压低解码性能：语义解码可被有意识抵抗。</span></p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="fixed:16.50" afterLineSpacing="fixed:6.00" marginLeft="14" indent="0" defaultTabSize="72" bulletSize="100%"><span color="rgba(22, 34, 46, 1)" fontSize="11.5" fontFamily="Heiti SC" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">fMRI 无法做成实时 BCI；语义重建 ≠ 逐字转录。</span></p>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </content>
      </shape>
    </data>
    <note id="bMH">
      <content>
        <p textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.2" defaultTabSize="72"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">这是整条技术链的 proof of principle：非侵入、语义层面、跨模态。</span></p>
        <p><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">两个必须念的数字：72–82% 的时间点语义相似度显著高于随机；只读解码文本也能答对 9/16 道阅读理解题。</span></p>
        <p><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 1)" fontSize="12" fontFamily="等线" bold="false" italic="false" strikethrough="false" underline="false">右边的「不能就此说读心」同样重要——尤其是跨被试训练几乎失败，以及解码可以被主动抵抗。</span></p>
      </content>
    </note>
